[node name="Earth05" type="Node2D" unique_id=787703886]
editor_description = "Wisps kill on touch. A perfect throw (the rock turns white) or a big rock defeats one; a sloppy small rock only shoves it. Hold A until the shadow leaves your feet: a snake comes out instead of a pillar; steer it with the arrows, A again hardens it. Its head shoves a wisp: ram the ledge wisp into the spikes."
